title: "The Veritocratic Economy"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Noah
    family-names: Davidson
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/VelumSpiritus/Veritocratic-Economy"
abstract: >-
  An economic model that dissolves the extraction measured in the market
  record without seizing the means of production and without pricing the
  sovereign. Tax the produced surplus at the residual inflation rate,
  never the person. Return the proceeds as universal income commensurate
  with each human's attributable gift to the commons. Four documents:
  The Question and Its Answer (the central measurement and mechanism),
  Property Without Private (the deed as stock), The Written Law (ten
  laws, each written twice), and the veritocratic rate module.
keywords:
  - veritocratic economy
  - economic model
  - extraction measurement
  - universal income
  - property without private
  - residual inflation rate
  - commons return
  - deliberate line
date-released: "2026-10-26"
